  "solution": "The logic followed here is : **(1st number + 3rd number) × 7 = 2nd number**\n\nGiven :\n\n \n• (5, 98, 9)\n\n​(5 + 9) × 7 = 98\n\n14 × 7 = 98\n\n98 = 98 (LHS = RHS)\n\n \n• (10, 168, 14)\n\n​(10 + 14) × 7 = 168\n\n24 × 7 = 168\n\n168 = 168 (LHS = RHS)\n\n​So,\n\n \n• Option - (1) : (1, 28, 3)​\n\n​(1 + 3) × 7 = 28\n\n4 × 7 = 28\n\n**28 = 28 (LHS = RHS)**\n\n \n• Option - (2) : (7, 108, 23)​\n\n​(7 + 23) × 7 = 98\n\n30 × 7 = 108\n\n**210 ≠ 108 (LHS ≠ RHS)**\n\n \n• Option - (3) : (15, 248, 19)​\n\n​(15 + 19) × 7 = 248\n\n34 × 7 = 248\n\n**238 ≠ 248 (LHS ≠ RHS)**\n\n \n• Option - (4) : (3, 88, 17)​\n\n​(3 + 17) × 7 = 88\n\n20 × 7 = 88\n\n**140 ≠ 88 (LHS ≠ RHS)**\n\nHence, **\"Option - (1)\"** is the correct answer.\n\nae:Td9a,\n<p style",
